                <pb facs="0706" n="604" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg604"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.706/161: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in China
                        (Johnson)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-07-31T17:00:00-04:00">July 31, 1933—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>270. Your 627, July 27, 11 a.m., last paragraph. In the light of Peck’s and your
                    views that extension of informal good offices would be appropriate and useful,
                    Department authorizes you in your discretion to proceed as indicated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
